<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<title>Книга в Ухе</title>
<link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<style>
body {
  height: 100vh;
  margin: 0;
  background-color: #fff;
  font-family: "Product Sans", "Helvetica Neue", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica", sans-serif;
}
.error_box {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  align-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  height: 100%;
  padding: 0 15px;
}
.error_box .error_image {
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  background-color: #f0f1f2;
  border-radius: 30px;
  margin-right: 15px;
}
.error_box .error_image > div {
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  background: url("https://static.knigavuhe.org/svg/logo_kniga_v_uhe.svg") no-repeat center center;
  background-size: 80px 80px;
}
.error_message {
  text-align: left;
  padding: 15px 0;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: #111;
}
.error_box a {
  /* font: bold 11px Arial; */
  font-size: 17px;
  text-decoration: none;
  background-color: #EEEEEE;
  color: #3077c8;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  display: block;
}
.error_box a:hover {
  background-color: #e6e6e6;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<div class="error_box">
    <div class="error_image"><div></div></div>
    <div>
        <div class="error_message">Страница не найдена.</div>
        <a href="/">Вернуться на сайт</a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
